# Try the API from Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client). Start it first: the "https" profile.
# Emails aren't sent while Email:Enabled is false: open the newest file in Msanga.Presentation/App_Data/emails and
# copy its 6-digit code into the requests below.

@api = https://localhost:7311

### The greeting (no sign-in)
GET {{api}}/api/hello
Accept: application/json

### Create an account (always 204)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Okon",
  "schoolSurname": "",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "my old school bell"
}

### Confirm the email (the 6-digit code from the email)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/confirm-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "code": "482913" }

### Sign in: copy accessToken and refreshToken from the answer
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "password": "my old school bell" }

### Who am I
@accessToken = PASTE-THE-ACCESS-TOKEN
GET {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Edit my profile
PUT {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ada", "lastName": "Okon", "schoolSurname": "Bassey", "bio": "Class of 1998. Physics Club." }

### Find a school (try "fgcie", "govt coll umuahia", "unilag", "akwapoly")
GET {{api}}/api/communities?search=fgc%20ikot
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### One school (paste an id from the search)
GET {{api}}/api/communities/PASTE-A-SCHOOL-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh (the old refresh token stops working)
@refreshToken = PASTE-THE-REFRESH-TOKEN
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Forgot password (always 204)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ada@example.com" }

### Reset password (the 6-digit code from the email)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ada@example.com", "code": "482913", "newPassword": "a brand new password" }

### Sign out
POST {{api}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }
